    "created_at": "2018-04-04T18:10:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-04-04T18:12:53Z",
    "body": "I recommend also adding \"no-punctuate\" option, bringing options to off|on|no-punctuate.\r\n\r\nNo-punctuate would imply that autocorrect is on, but removes the sometimes tedious problem of removing punctuation whenever two spaces are pressed.  \r\n\r\nCurrently, to disable this behavior, it's all or nothing at the OS level (detailed here: http://osxdaily.com/2012/07/03/stop-the-period-automatically-typing-in-ios/) ",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
