    "updated_at": "2018-04-04T18:20:17Z",
    "body": "Blink supports this on HTMLElement although the value isn't in the IDL; it is queried on the focused element.. See https://cs.chromium.org/chromium/src/third_party/WebKit/Source/core/editing/ime/InputMethodController.cpp?type=cs&l=1342\r\n\r\nI support getting this spec'd. \"on\" and \"off\" are the only attribute values Blink supports (which appears to be case sensitive so there are likely some changes to Blink)",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
